  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan buys it in treasure yellow heaven and brings it out of Hu Immortal blessed land with Moving Perspective Cup Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          507
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven",
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
          "gu_moving_perspective_cup_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Mo Yao’s will in his mind reading ordinary thoughts, Fang Yuan can think only through Space Thought Gu. With that Gu as the main component and other Gu assisting, the thoughts carry space power, and Mo Yao’s will cannot read them even when she catches them. Long contact would still let her grow familiar with those space thoughts and break that defense.",
        "chapters": [
          569
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "concealing-thoughts",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_mo_yao"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later stops a long train of thought because more thoughts would rise, and even with Space Thought Gu hiding them he cannot guarantee she finds no way around it.",
        "chapters": [
          574
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
